{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Super Cricket Fighter Turbo",
    "steam_appid": 3522620,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imagine the intensity of a 2D fighting game meeting the all-so-British elegance and sense of mastery of a Cricket match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That's Super Cricket Fighter Turbo! A pixelated 1v1 arcade game where two players are clashing on the same screen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab a good friend, start a match, and FIGHT!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local Multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse, keyboard, or gamepad controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nail-biting hard AI players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Training Coop Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Juicy 8-bit art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dedicated insult button</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's nothing like real cricket, but it's fun!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super Cricket Fighter Turbo is a PC remaster of the first game we ever received a review for, 10 years ago~  <br>It was delisted from mobile stores over time, and we wanted to bring it back for that special occasion. <br>We hope you enjoy it as much as we enjoyed working on it!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imagine the intensity of a 2D fighting game meeting the all-so-British elegance and sense of mastery of a Cricket match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That's Super Cricket Fighter Turbo! A pixelated 1v1 arcade game where two players are clashing on the same screen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab a good friend, start a match, and FIGHT!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local Multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse, keyboard, or gamepad controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nail-biting hard AI players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Training Coop Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Juicy 8-bit art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dedicated insult button</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's nothing like real cricket, but it's fun!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super Cricket Fighter Turbo is a PC remaster of the first game we ever received a review for, 10 years ago~  <br>It was delisted from mobile stores over time, and we wanted to bring it back for that special occasion. <br>We hope you enjoy it as much as we enjoyed working on it!</p>",
    "short_description": "Super Cricket Fighter Turbo is Pong on steroids.",
